This repository builds on third-party components, each distributed under its
own license and installed via `setup.sh` (see the respective upstream
repositories):

- VGGT / VGGT-SLAM (MIT-SPARK) — https://github.com/MIT-SPARK/VGGT_SPARK
- SAM3 (Meta) — https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam3
- Perception Encoder (Meta) — https://github.com/facebookresearch/perception_models
- SALAD (Dominic101) — https://github.com/Dominic101/salad

The `vggt_slam/` and `vggt_slam_official/` packages derive from VGGT-SLAM 2.0
and retain its original attribution.
